 The create request timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had already been created, so I didn't send it again. That avoided a duplicate incident and a second page to on-call. INC-0001 covers the failure, the partial rollback and the retry, and lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and what caused the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}